          'Website redesign and Google business presence setup to strengthen visibility in local search.',
        tags: ['WordPress', 'Redesign', 'Google Business Profile'],
        url: 'https://fletesymudanzasjimenez.com/',
        tone: 'yellow',
      },

      {
        name: 'Prueba EDI',
        type: 'Digital product',
        contribution: 'Frontend',
        description:
          'Astro landing page presenting a digital platform for child development assessment.',
        tags: ['Astro', 'Frontend', 'Responsive'],
        url: 'https://pruebaedi.com/',
        tone: 'blue',
      },

      {
        name: 'Digital Catalog',
        type: 'Digital product',
        contribution: 'Design + Frontend',
        description:
          'Landing page for a digital catalog platform built around product management and WhatsApp enquiries.',
        tags: ['Astro', 'UX/UI', 'Product'],
        url: 'https://catalogo-digital.extendevs.com/',
        tone: 'yellow',
      },

      {
        name: 'Lala & José Invitation',
        type: 'Web experience',
        contribution: 'Design + Frontend',
        description:
          'Mobile-first digital invitation featuring locations, countdown, gallery and guest messages.',
        tags: ['HTML', 'CSS', 'JavaScript'],
        url: 'https://dulce2130.github.io/invitacion-Lala-Jose.io/',
        tone: 'lavender',
      },
    ],
